H behavior verification; temporary port-9000 listeners and files were bounded evidence fixtures and were removed; and all reboots served the mandatory restart protocol. Final observations show no port-9000 listener, no failed services, healthy package state, and no abandoned test files. The restart protocol is strong for all three nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity independently corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered system/network or task behavior.","evidence_ids":["cmd-2d58f437888b43ef","cmd-466990d2178c463e","cmd-427b545a36fa437f","cmd-d91d0543d0974579","cmd-2e93c7a565d8499e","cmd-ff755e93bda348ff","cmd-70a3074cfaaa4b01","cmd-bd650ba142864606","cmd-b3742142ae944192","cmd-7842746bda34489c","cmd-2e68eb0347184955","cmd-c5da7cb684154fdc","cmd-0ac1dad6d0bc4bfa","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_executor:node3:failed-services","global:after_executor:node3:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"The persistent UFW firewall and global SSH allowance are fully demonstrated, including survival of a real node1 reboot. Port 9000 behaves correctly for node2 and node3 and has an appropriate catch-all rule, but the captured successful connection from node1 itself prevents the literal “only from node2/everywhere else rejected” outcome from being fully satisfied. Mandatory restart evidence is coherent and complete across all managed nodes.","limitations":["The evidence directly tests port 9000 from node2, node3, and node1 itself, but not from an additional external IPv4 source or any IPv6 source; coverage of those sources relies on the displayed catch-all rules.","The successful node1 self-connection may reflect local-host/loopback handling rather than externally routed ingress, but the public instruction does not exempt node1-originated traffic, so it remains a material contradiction."]}
